Delivery is polling: what you send is stored the moment the call answers and reaches them the
next time their client looks, so nothing has gone wrong when no reply comes back inside your Run.

They are reading you in a line-oriented terminal, so write plain sentences and keep it to a
couple of them. No headings, no tables, no code blocks.
